        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway): regenerate native hook descriptors when relay unavailable after restart",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nNative hook descriptors were not regenerated when the relay was unavailable during gateway restart, causing hooks to silently fail until manual intervention. Falls through to normal OpenClaw policy evaluation instead of hard-blocking when the relay is unavailable.\n\nDistinguishes pre-invocation vs post-invocation native hook relay failures. Pre-invocation unavailability (gateway restart, stale bridge, port mismatch) falls through to normal policy evaluation. Post-invocation failures (handler crash, malformed reply) stay fail-closed.\n\n## Linked context\n\nCloses #89325\n\n## Real Behavior Proof\n\n### Test Results (vitest 4.1.9)\n\nRebased onto origin/main (b3301e32127).\n\n```\n✓ src/cli/native-hook-relay-cli.test.ts (20 tests, 100% pass, 21.62s)\n✓ extensions/codex/src/app-server/approval-bridge.test.ts (80 tests, 100% pass, 46.59s)\n```\n\n### Commands\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs --config test/vitest/vitest.cli.config.ts src/cli/native-hook-relay-cli.test.ts\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs --config test/vitest/vitest.extension-codex-app-server-tools.config.ts extensions/codex/src/app-server/approval-bridge.test.ts\n```\n\n### Before/After\n\n- Before: Any native hook relay catch block error returned \"unavailable\" - both pre-invocation unavailability and post-invocation handler crashes treated the same\n- After: Pre-invocation failures fall through to normal policy evaluation; post-invocation failures stay fail-closed with distinct message via `hasNativeHookRelayInvocation` check\n\n### What was not tested\n\nLive Codex gateway restart/drain cycle on real Codex harness (requires macOS with Codex setup)\n\n## Risk checklist\n\n- Did user-visible behavior change? Yes - pre-invocation relay unavailability no longer hard-blocks approval\n- Did config, environment, or migration behavior change? No\n- Did security, auth, secrets, network, or tool execution behavior change? Yes - fallthrough changes approval path\n- What is the highest-risk area? Security boundary: pre/post invocation failure distinction\n- How is that risk mitigated? `hasNativeHookRelayInvocation` tracks relay contact; post-invocation failures remain fail-closed\n\nRebased onto origin/main (b3301e32127). Latest commit: 0b1f7d2111d",
